{{>layout/header}}

<link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
    :root {
        --primary-color: #2563eb;
        --primary-light: #eff6ff;
        --text-main: #1e293b;
        --text-sub: #64748b;
        --border-color: #e2e8f0;
        --bg-light: #f8fafc;
    }

    body {
        font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #334155;
        background: #ffffff;
    }

    .hero-section {
        padding: 90px 40px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc 0%, #eff6ff 100%);
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .hero-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 7px 14px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #dbeafe;
        color: #1d4ed8;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .hero-title {
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--text-main);
        letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .hero-description {
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 20px auto 0;
        color: var(--text-sub);
        font-size: 1.08rem;
    }

    .hero-keywords {
        margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .hero-keyword {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 4px;
        padding: 6px 12px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
        color: #334155;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .section-title {
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        color: var(--text-main);
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .section-description {
        color: var(--text-sub);
        margin-top: -1.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
    }

    .skill-badge {
        background: var(--primary-light);
        color: var(--primary-color);
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 0.2rem;
        display: inline-block;
    }

    .card {
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 10px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08);
        transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -8px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.15);
    }

    .experience-card {
        height: 100%;
        padding: 24px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: #ffffff;
    }

    .experience-icon {
        width: 48px;
        height: 48px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: var(--primary-light);
        color: var(--primary-color);
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .portfolio-card {
        height: 100%;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .portfolio-card .card-body {
        padding: 24px;
    }

    .portfolio-card h5 {
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .portfolio-card ul {
        padding-left: 18px;
    }

    .portfolio-card li {
        margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .project-type {
        background: #f1f5f9;
        color: #475569;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .project-link {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        margin-top: 12px;
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #f8fafc;
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        color: #2563eb;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .project-link:hover {
        background: #eff6ff;
        color: #1d4ed8;
    }

    .architecture-card {
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: #0f172a;
    }

    .architecture-step {
        padding: 10px;
    }

    .architecture-step i {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .architecture-step p {
        margin-bottom: 0;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .timeline-item {
        border-left: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
        padding-left: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        position: relative;
    }

    .timeline-item::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        left: -6px;
        top: 3px;
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        background: var(--primary-color);
        border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .timeline-date {
        color: #64748b;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .career-role {
        color: #2563eb;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .login-status {
        margin-top: 28px;
    }

    .bottom-message {
        padding: 28px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: #f8fafc;
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .hero-section {
            padding: 60px 20px;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 2.4rem;
        }

        .hero-description {
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
    }
</style>


<div class="container py-5">

    <!-- 1. Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero-section text-center rounded-3">

        <span class="hero-badge">
            Java · Spring Boot · AWS
        </span>

        <h1 class="display-3 hero-title">
            천현종
        </h1>

        <h2 class="h4 fw-bold text-primary mt-3">
            Java/Spring 기반 백엔드 개발자
        </h2>

        <p class="hero-description">
            웹 서비스 개발부터 AWS 배포와 운영까지 직접 경험하며,
            애플리케이션이 실제 환경에서 안정적으로 동작하는 과정까지 이해하려고 노력해왔습니다.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-keywords">
            <span class="hero-keyword">Java</span>
            <span class="hero-keyword">Spring Boot</span>
            <span class="hero-keyword">MariaDB</span>
            <span class="hero-keyword">AWS EC2/RDS</span>
            <span class="hero-keyword">Nginx</span>
            <span class="hero-keyword">CI/CD</span>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4">

            <a href="https://github.com/Hj-1000/practice1"
               class="btn btn-dark px-4 mx-1"
               target="_blank"
               rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <i class="fab fa-github me-2"></i>
                GitHub 프로젝트 보기
            </a>

            <!--
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-primary px-4 mx-1">
                Blog
            </a>

            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary px-4 mx-1">
                이력서 다운로드
            </a>
            -->

            <div class="login-status">

                {{#userName}}
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <span class="badge bg-light text-dark p-2 border">
                            Logged in: {{userName}}
                        </span>

                        <a href="/logout"
                           class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger">
                            로그아웃
                        </a>
                    </div>
                {{/userName}}

                {{^userName}}
                    <button type="button"
                            class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-4"
                            data-bs-toggle="modal"
                            data-bs-target="#loginModal">
                        <i class="fas fa-play me-2"></i>
                        실제 프로젝트 체험하기
                    </button>

                    <div class="small text-muted mt-2">
                        로그인 후 실제 서비스의 상세 기능을 확인할 수 있습니다.
                    </div>
                {{/userName}}

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- 2. About Me -->
    <section class="my-5">

        <h2 class="section-title">
            About Me
        </h2>

        <p class="section-description">
            개발 결과물뿐 아니라 배포와 운영 과정까지 직접 경험하며 서비스 전체 흐름을 이해하고 있습니다.
        </p>

        <div class="row g-4">

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="experience-card">
                    <div class="experience-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-code fa-lg"></i>
                    </div>

                    <h5 class="fw-bold">
                        Backend Development
                    </h5>

                    <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                        Java와 Spring Boot를 기반으로 REST API와
                        JPA/MyBatis를 활용한 웹 서비스를 개발했습니다.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="experience-card">
                    <div class="experience-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-server fa-lg"></i>
                    </div>

                    <h5 class="fw-bold">
                        Deployment & Operation
                    </h5>

                    <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                        AWS EC2/RDS와 Linux 환경을 직접 구성하고
                        Nginx, HTTPS, Docker 등을 활용해 서비스를 운영했습니다.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="experience-card">
                    <div class="experience-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-tools fa-lg"></i>
                    </div>

                    <h5 class="fw-bold">
                        Problem Solving
                    </h5>

                    <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                        배포 환경에서 발생한 네트워크와 HTTPS 문제를
                        로그와 서버 설정을 확인하며 직접 원인을 찾아 해결했습니다.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- 3. Core Experience -->
    <section class="my-5">

        <h2 class="section-title">
            Core Experience
        </h2>

        <p class="section-description">
            개인 프로젝트를 통해 개발부터 배포와 운영까지 직접 경험했습니다.
        </p>

        <div class="row g-3">

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card p-3 text-center h-100">
                    <i class="fas fa-cloud fa-2x text-primary mb-2"></i>

                    <h6 class="fw-bold">
                        AWS 서비스 배포
                    </h6>

                    <small class="text-muted">
                        EC2 + RDS 기반 웹 서비스 구성
                    </small>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card p-3 text-center h-100">
                    <i class="fas fa-lock fa-2x text-success mb-2"></i>

                    <h6 class="fw-bold">
                        HTTPS 보안 적용
                    </h6>

                    <small class="text-muted">
                        Nginx + Let's Encrypt 기반 HTTPS 구성
                    </small>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card p-3 text-center h-100">
                    <i class="fas fa-rocket fa-2x text-danger mb-2"></i>

                    <h6 class="fw-bold">
                        CI/CD 자동화
                    </h6>

                    <small class="text-muted">
                        GitHub Actions + CodeDeploy 기반 배포 자동화
                    </small>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card p-3 text-center h-100">
                    <i class="fas fa-user-shield fa-2x text-warning mb-2"></i>

                    <h6 class="fw-bold">
                        OAuth2 인증
                    </h6>

                    <small class="text-muted">
                        Google · Naver 소셜 로그인 구현
                    </small>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card p-3 text-center h-100">
                    <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt fa-2x text-info mb-2"></i>

                    <h6 class="fw-bold">
                        위치 기반 서비스
                    </h6>

                    <small class="text-muted">
                        현재 위치 기준 1km 맛집 조회 기능 구현
                    </small>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card p-3 text-center h-100">
                    <i class="fas fa-network-wired fa-2x text-secondary mb-2"></i>

                    <h6 class="fw-bold">
                        서버 요청 흐름 구성
                    </h6>

                    <small class="text-muted">
                        Nginx Reverse Proxy + Spring Boot 연동
                    </small>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- 4. Tech Stack -->
    <section class="my-5">

        <h2 class="section-title">
            Tech Stack
        </h2>

        <div class="mb-4">

            <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">
                Backend
            </h5>

            <div id="backend-skills">
                <span class="skill-badge">Java</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">Spring Boot</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">Spring Security</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">OAuth2</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">JPA</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">MyBatis</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">MariaDB</span>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="mb-4">

            <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">
                Infra & Deployment
            </h5>

            <div id="infra-skills">
                <span class="skill-badge">AWS EC2</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">AWS RDS</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">Linux</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">Nginx</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">GitHub Actions</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">CodeDeploy</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">Docker</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">DuckDNS</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">Let's Encrypt</span>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div>

            <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">
                Web
            </h5>

            <div>
                <span class="skill-badge">JavaScript</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">Next.js</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">HTML/CSS</span>
                <span class="skill-badge">Kakao Map API</span>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- 5. Architecture -->
    <section class="my-5">

        <h2 class="section-title">
            Architecture
        </h2>

        <div class="card architecture-card p-4 text-white">

            <div class="row text-center align-items-center">

                <div class="col-6 col-md architecture-step">
                    <i class="fas fa-desktop fa-2x"></i>
                    <p>Client</p>
                </div>

                <div class="col-6 col-md architecture-step">
                    <i class="fas fa-shield-alt fa-2x"></i>
                    <p>Nginx HTTPS</p>
                </div>

                <div class="col-6 col-md architecture-step">
                    <i class="fas fa-server fa-2x"></i>
                    <p>Spring Boot</p>
                </div>

                <div class="col-6 col-md architecture-step">
                    <i class="fas fa-database fa-2x"></i>
                    <p>AWS RDS</p>
                </div>

            </div>

            <hr>

            <div class="text-center">

                <i class="fab fa-github me-2"></i>
                GitHub

                <span class="mx-2">→</span>

                <i class="fas fa-cogs me-2"></i>
                GitHub Actions

                <span class="mx-2">→</span>

                <i class="fas fa-cloud me-2"></i>
                AWS CodeDeploy

                <span class="mx-2">→</span>

                <i class="fas fa-server me-2"></i>
                AWS EC2

            </div>

        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- 6. Projects -->
    <section class="my-5">

        <h2 class="section-title">
            Portfolio Projects
        </h2>

        <p class="section-description">
            프로젝트 카드를 클릭하면 실제 결과물 또는 관련 저장소를 확인할 수 있습니다.
        </p>

        <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-3 g-4">

            <!-- 개인 프로젝트 -->
            <div class="col">

                <div class="card portfolio-card shadow-sm"
                     onclick="checkLoginAndRedirect('/reviews', {{#userName}}true{{/userName}}{{^userName}}false{{/userName}})"
                     style="cursor:pointer;">

                    <div class="card-body">

                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center text-primary mb-3">

                            <i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt fa-2x"></i>

                            <span class="badge rounded-pill"
                                  style="background-color: #eff6ff; color: #2563eb; font-weight: 600;">
                                개인 프로젝트
                            </span>

                        </div>

                        <h5>
                            맛집 기록 서비스
                        </h5>

                        <p class="small text-muted mb-3">
                            Spring Boot 기반으로 직접 개발하고
                            AWS 환경에 배포·운영한 개인 프로젝트입니다.
                        </p>

                        <ul class="small text-muted">

                            <li>
                                <strong>Backend:</strong>
                                Spring Boot, JPA, MariaDB
                            </li>

                            <li>
                                <strong>Infra:</strong>
                                AWS EC2/RDS, Nginx, HTTPS
                            </li>

                            <li>
                                <strong>Point:</strong>
                                위치 기반 맛집 조회 및 JPA 최적화
                            </li>

                        </ul>

                        <div class="project-link">
                            실제 프로젝트 체험하기
                            <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- 와일리 프로젝트 -->
            <div class="col">

                <div class="card portfolio-card shadow-sm"
                     onclick="checkLoginAndRedirect('https://www.gangnamon.or.kr/', {{#userName}}true{{/userName}}{{^userName}}false{{/userName}})"
                     style="cursor:pointer;">

                    <div class="card-body">

                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center text-primary mb-3">

                            <i class="fas fa-hospital fa-2x"></i>

                            <span class="badge rounded-pill"
                                  style="background-color: #fefce8; color: #a16207; font-weight: 600;">
                                와일리
                            </span>

                        </div>

                        <h5>
                            강남구중독관리통합지원센터
                        </h5>

                        <p class="small text-muted mb-3">
                            와일리 재직 당시 참여한 신규 홈페이지 구축 프로젝트입니다.
                        </p>

                        <ul class="small text-muted">

                            <li>
                                <strong>Tech:</strong>
                                Next.js
                            </li>

                            <li>
                                <strong>Role:</strong>
                                홈페이지 구축 및 배포 이슈 대응
                            </li>

                            <li>
                                <strong>Point:</strong>
                                실제 운영 홈페이지 확인 가능
                            </li>

                        </ul>

                        <div class="project-link">
                            실제 홈페이지 보기
                            <i class="fas fa-external-link-alt"></i>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- 팀 프로젝트 -->
            <div class="col">

                <div class="card portfolio-card shadow-sm"
                     onclick="checkLoginAndRedirect('https://github.com/Hj-1000/HotelProj/', {{#userName}}true{{/userName}}{{^userName}}false{{/userName}})"
                     style="cursor:pointer;">

                    <div class="card-body">

                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center text-primary mb-3">

                            <i class="fas fa-hotel fa-2x"></i>

                            <span class="badge rounded-pill"
                                  style="background-color: #ecfdf5; color: #059669; font-weight: 600;">
                                팀 프로젝트
                            </span>

                        </div>

                        <h5>
                            호텔 예약 프로그램
                        </h5>

                        <p class="small text-muted mb-3">
                            팀장으로 참여해 백엔드 설계와
                            주문·권한 관리 기능을 담당한 프로젝트입니다.
                        </p>

                        <ul class="small text-muted">

                            <li>
                                <strong>Tech:</strong>
                                Spring Boot, JPA, MariaDB
                            </li>

                            <li>
                                <strong>Role:</strong>
                                백엔드 설계 및 주문/권한 관리
                            </li>

                            <li>
                                <strong>Point:</strong>
                                ERD 및 API 문서화, 접근 권한 분리
                            </li>

                        </ul>

                        <div class="project-link">
                            GitHub에서 프로젝트 보기
                            <i class="fab fa-github"></i>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- 7. Career & Education -->
    <div class="row">

        <!-- Career -->
        <section class="col-md-6 my-5">

            <h2 class="section-title">
                Career
            </h2>

            <div class="timeline-item">

                <div class="timeline-date">
                    2025.07 – 2025.10
                </div>

                <h6 class="fw-bold">
                    와일리 (Wiley)
                </h6>

                <div class="career-role">
                    공공부문팀
                </div>

                <p class="small text-muted mt-2">
                    공공기관 홈페이지 구축 및 제안 업무에 참여했습니다.
                    Next.js 홈페이지 구축과 배포 이슈 대응,
                    국립보건연구원 홈페이지 통합개편 제안서 작성 등을 경험했습니다.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="timeline-item">

                <div class="timeline-date">
                    2023.01 – 2024.03
                </div>

                <h6 class="fw-bold">
                    (주)네오엔비즈
